      "writtenOn": "2019-10-10T03:29:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just APEX_FILECONTEXT_INFOS?\n\nIf apex_name and file_contexts could break things, we could add more conditions here to prevent settings that are invalid or don\u0027t make sense. For example, we could prohibit file_context to be set for installable APEXes. We really don\u0027t need to support the full flexibility.",
      "parentUuid": "c3848353_afd158a0",
      "range": {
